      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Learned A.G.A has submitted that in the present matter the chargesheet has been submitted against the petitioners, but he is not certain whether cognizance has not been taken thereon or not.\n4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 925,
